// Localizable.strings — English (en) translations for the OneAI macOS app.
//
// Keyed by the Chinese literal that appears in the Swift source (SwiftUI
// Text/Button/Label/Toggle/Picker/TextField/.help accept a LocalizedStringKey
// and auto-resolve it through this file, so the view code stays unchanged).
// Entries with %@ / %d are runtime format strings wrapped via
// NSLocalizedString + String(format:) in the source (Errors / relativeTime /
// ScenarioEditor validation / speaker counts). Preset scenario CONTENT
// (names, persona prompts, opener lines) is bilingual data in AgentStore
// (zhPresets / enPresets), not chrome — it is not localized here.

